        "Content": "For Sale by Private Treaty\r\n16 Sliabh Alainn\r\nMitchelstown\r\nCo. Cork P67 HD52\r\n\r\n\r\n3-Bedroom House. C.1000sqft\r\nGuide: €325,000\r\nMichael Dorgan Auctioneers & Valuers are delighted to present new to the market, this immaculately presented 3 bedroom family home with a sought-after development. Offering bright spacious living accommodation, a superb location only a short walk from the amenities of Mitchelstown town centre on the foothills of the Galtee Mountains. A short commute from Cork, Limerick & Clonmel. Viewing strictly by appointment.\r\n\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\nLocated just off Brigown, 2 minutes walk from Mitchelstown town centre with its wealth of amenities, Living Health Clinic, schools & shops. This property is just 3.7km from Junction 13 of the M8 Motorway & just 30minutes from the Jack Lynch Tunnel.\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nSpacious property c.1000sqft. BER C2\r\nMains water & sewerage, recent gas boiler.\r\nAreas are set out in Lawn, cobble block & patio.\r\nOff street parking for two cars. Wide side access.\r\nJust over 30 minutes from the Jack Lynch Tunnel.\r\n2 Minutes from the town and amenities (3km).\r\n\r\n\r\nAccommodation: (Ground Floor)\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway:\r\n4.55m x 2.10m\r\n14.93ft x 6.88ft\r\nFloor tiles.\r\nRadiator & power points.\r\n\r\n\r\nW/C:\r\n1.49m x 1.40m\r\n4.88ft x 4.61ft\r\nFloor tiles.\r\nWHB & Toilet.\r\nRadiator.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLiving room:\r\n4.98m x 3.23m\r\n16.35ft x 10.61ft\r\nOpen fireplace with marble surround.\r\n(gas pipe for gas fires)\r\nPower points & Radiator.\r\nBay window. Blinds.\r\nTimber floor.\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining room:\r\n5.35m x 3.97m\r\n17.57ft x 13.02ft\r\nWall & floor units. Stainless back splash.\r\nPlumbed for dishwasher.\r\nLight fittings, radiator.\r\nBuilt in oven & hob, extractor.\r\nStainless hot/cold sink.\r\nBlinds & power points.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: (Master bedroom)\r\n3.86m x 3.26m\r\n12.66ft x 10.69ft\r\nCarpet & blinds.\r\nPower points & Radiator.\r\nWardrobe.\r\n\r\nEnsuite:\r\n2.58m x 0.87m\r\n8.47ft x 2.87ft\r\nFloor tiles. Shower.\r\nTiled floor to ceiling. (recent)\r\nWHB & Toilet.\r\nExtractor.\r\n\r\nBathroom:\r\n2.66m x 1.948m\r\n8.73ft x 6.39ft\r\nFloor tiles.\r\nTiled floor to ceiling.\r\nWHB & Toilet.\r\nBathtub.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\r\n3.53m x 2.96m\r\n11.59ft x 9.72ft\r\nCarpet & blinds.\r\nPower points & Radiator.\r\nBuilt in wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:\r\n2.45m x 2.27m\r\n8.04ft x 7.48ft\r\nCarpet & blinds.\r\nPower points & Radiator.\r\nBuilt in wardrobe & units.\r\n\r\n\r\nTerms:\r\n\r\nGuide: €325,000\r\nThis property is being offered for Sale by private treaty. Terms are available and to be negotiated on application with agents:\r\n\r\nMichael Dorgan Auctioneers & Valuers\r\nBaldwin Street\r\nMitchelstown\r\nCo. Cork\r\n\r\n(025) 85700\r\nEmail: Info@michaeldorgan .i e\r\n\r\nViewing: Strictly by Appointment only.\r\n\r\nThe above particulars are issued by Michael Dorgan, Auctioneers & Valuers on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars but the company do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. Potential purchasers must clarify all information contained within marketing documents with their own engineers/surveyors and solicitors. Failure to do so cannot be considered the agents liability.\r\n\r\nAll reasonable offers will be submitted to vendors. These particulars do not form any contract for Sale or lease subsequently entered into.\r\n\r\n\r\nInformation gathered from public sources may be subject to copy write, we are happy to acknowledge same if it becomes known to us.\r\nAny form of this brochure may not be reused"
      },
